    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273804</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、危ない……
近づかないの……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It might be dangerous,
&lt;Dio&gt;... Don't go up to it...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274020</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉっ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぷっは～、
びっくらこいた、
おどろいた、と</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ooowaaaah~
Well, that just about
scared my socks off.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>危うくバラバラになるとこだど。
帰ったら文句言ってやんねぇと、
ぶつぶつぶつ、と…</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I really thought I was fixin' to go to
pieces there. Once I get back, I'll have
to tell her off for that one, won't I...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review Translation</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんだ、おめぇら、
人のことジロジロ見て</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, you lot. What are
ya just standin' there
and starin' at me for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Review translation</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はっはっはぁ～ん、
このアルベルト様の格好良さに
見とれてるんだべな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh heh he~h. Taken
with the Great Albert's
ravishin' good looks, are ya?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274540</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274696</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだんだ、そうだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yep, that's
my name.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274696</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルン様のお達しで、
おめぇらのとこに来てやっただ。
感謝せぇよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>By Her Eminence, Norn's proclamation,
I've come here to meet all of ya.
You should be real grateful for that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ノルンの……！？
どういうこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Norn's...!?
But why?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274952</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ～ぁ、
長旅してきたもんで、
腹減っちまっただなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaaah... My journey's
been real long, so I'm
gettin' awful hungry...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274952</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふかし芋の
ひとつやふたつ、
出てこんもんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya wouldn't happen to
have any taters you
could cook up for me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃ、じゃあ……
ひとまず中に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-Well... Okay...
Then, come in,
I guess...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275156</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_010_030_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あー、そったら中行くだが。
芋だけじゃなく、
茶も出すんだど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahh... But if we're goin' inside,
you'll have to get me some
tea, not just some taters.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
